**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.claude
**/.env*
**/*.md
docs
tools
compose*.yaml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
# Tests are not built into the image.
apps/*/test
